atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/ef39b40292391a088d53dab9956099d0d51f4944/ss_ef39b40292391a088d53dab9956099d0d51f4944.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762164464","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/ef39b40292391a088d53dab9956099d0d51f4944/ss_ef39b40292391a088d53dab9956099d0d51f4944.600x338.jpg?t=1762164464"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/d9e3b8fdc5ea86c6419bccae40729d150de5956e/ss_d9e3b8fdc5ea86c6419bccae40729d150de5956e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762164464","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561490/d9e3b8fdc5ea86c6419bccae40729d150de5956e/ss_d9e3b8fdc5ea86c6419bccae40729d150de5956e.600x338.jpg?t=1762164464"}],"short_description":"Cell Knights: TD is a Isometric 2.5D cozy tower defense game. Inspired by WC3 mazing tower defense and Clay like art style. Build and strategize your maze, place your towers correctly with each has their own unique shooting mechanics. Perfect for someone who loves tower defense game.","steam_appid":3561490,"support_info":{"email":"nutsaidstudios@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}